  m_text: "Malcolm the Otter arrives at 10:30 AM holding coffee while meetings are
    already ongoing. Other otters are actively participating in meetings and handling
    operations tasks. Malcolm casually greets colleagues and slowly settles down
    at his desk. A clock zooms in showing \u201C10:30 AM\u201D."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
